{"suttaId":"sn46.17","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-v","vriCode":"s0305m.mul","paras":[502,513],"vripara":"198"},"segments":{"sn46.17:0.3":"Pāraṅgamasuttaṃ","sn46.17:1.1":"“Sattime, bhikkhave, bojjhaṅgā bhāvitā bahulīkatā apārā pāraṃ gamanāya saṃvattanti.","sn46.17:1.2":"Katame satta?","sn46.17:1.3":"Satisambojjhaṅgo … pe … upekkhāsambojjhaṅgo – ime kho, bhikkhave, satta bojjhaṅgā bhāvitā bahulīkatā apārā pāraṃ gamanāya saṃvattantī”ti.","sn46.17:2.1":"“Appakā te manussesu, ye janā pāragāmino;","sn46.17:2.3":"Athāyaṃ itarā pajā, tīramevānudhāvati.","sn46.17:3.1":"“Ye ca kho sammadakkhāte, dhamme dhammānuvattino;","sn46.17:3.3":"Te janā pāramessanti, maccudheyyaṃ suduttaraṃ.","sn46.17:4.1":"“Kaṇhaṃ dhammaṃ vippahāya, sukkaṃ bhāvetha paṇḍito;","sn46.17:4.3":"Okā anokamāgamma, viveke yattha dūramaṃ.","sn46.17:5.1":"“Tatrābhiratimiccheyya, hitvā kāme akiñcano;","sn46.17:5.3":"Pariyodapeyya attānaṃ, cittaklesehi paṇḍito.","sn46.17:6.1":"“Yesaṃ sambodhiyaṅgesu, sammā cittaṃ subhāvitaṃ;","sn46.17:6.3":"Ādānappaṭinissagge, anupādāya ye ratā;","sn46.17:6.5":"Khīṇāsavā jutimanto, te loke parinibbutā”ti.","sn46.17:6.7":"sattamaṃ;"},"attha":null,"tika":null}
